ht:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>○</span></span><span>推荐</span><span>【</span><span>财库里水汇</span><span>】</span><span>，</span><span>新开、皇宫一样金碧辉煌，人均150左右</span></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\"><span>25:00 - 30:00行程规划：第四天</span></p><span></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>上午</span><span>：</span><span>731纪念馆</span><span>（免费，</span><span>需提前预约。会</span><span>沉重但值得了解历史）。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>下午</span><span>：</span><span>哈工大</span><span>参观：</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>○</span></span><span>俄式主楼、暖廊、校内博物馆、导弹展示。</span></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\"><span>30:00 - 40:00美食推荐（重点！）</span></p><span></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>烧烤</span><span>：</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>○</span></span><span>涮肚一条街（和兴路）</span><span>：家家不踩雷</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>○</span></span><span>老式烧烤：都差不多，感兴趣可尝试，谈不上好吃但不难吃，</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>○</span></span><span>野腰烧烤</span><span>：黄油大</span><span>腰子</span><span>有男性拳头大，烤油边可以一串吃饱。</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>火锅</span><span>：清真铜锅涮肉（</span><span>阳</span><span>顺斋、老</span><span>康</span><span>火锅）</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>炒菜</span><span>：知音酒楼、老</span><span>仁义</span><span>、张包铺（包子+熏酱）</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>烤肉</span><span>：齐齐哈尔烤肉（</span><span>找评价好的团购就行</span><span>）</span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><span>●</span></span><span>铁锅炖</span><span>：</span><span>家家不踩雷，找团购即可。百一大地锅（建议人多去），</span><span>三河屯（</span><span>环境好</span><span>）</span></p><span><br></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\"><span>40:00 - 45:00其他实用贴士</span></p><span></span><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-a